name: "Cryo Conduit"
description: "A super-insulated cryogenic fluid duct. Transports water, cryofluid, and chilled water at elevated velocity and pressure without leaks. Does not accept side liquid inputs. Molten lava or slag will undergo extreme thermal shock and solidify, freezing the flow inside."
